    <section class="mt-12 max-w-4xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Come Game App Bonuses and Promotions</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
        Gaming platforms often promote welcome bonuses or promotional rewards inside their apps.
