        <li>The precautions taken by the user</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">To stay safe:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
