        <li>Set a maximum spending limit</li>
        <li>Avoid chasing losses</li>
        <li>Take frequent breaks</li>
        <li>Stop playing if gaming affects daily life</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-foreground">
        For more information, visit our
        <a href="/responsible-gaming" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">responsible gaming guide with practical safety rules</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 max-w-4xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Conclusion</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
        This page provides a general overview of how the <strong>Come Game download process</strong>
