            recommended to download the file only from official provider pages and avoid third-party APK sites.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Who can download the Come Game App?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
            The Come Game App is intended only for users aged 18 years and above who understand the financial
