          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-foreground">Does the Come Game App guarantee winnings?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
